Hooks Rooster's ad blocker into the browser.

- chrome_browser_main.cc: starts and stops the browser-wide AdblockService
  (filter list updates) through RoosterBrowserMainExtraParts.
- chrome_content_browser_client.cc: puts AdblockURLLoaderFactory in front of
  frames', workers' and subframe navigations' requests, after Chrome's own
  proxies (webRequest, enterprise headers).
- chrome/browser/BUILD.gn: compiles //rooster/browser into //chrome/browser
  (it needs chrome/browser headers) and links the ad blocker.
- BUILD.gn: builds rooster_unittests with everything else.

The code itself lives under //rooster; these are the only places Chromium
calls into it.

